Today is Thursday.
It is now five thirty in the evening.
I am in Panampilly Nagar.
I meet Anitha at a popular cafe here.
Anitha asks, "Hello Maya, are you fine?"
I reply, "Yes, I am fine."
We order two cold coffees.
This month is February.
It is good weather here now.
We talk about our work.
There is always a lot of work at my office.
Anitha says, "I am also very busy every day."
She goes to the office every day.
Our cold coffee arrives.
We drink the coffee.
The coffee has a good taste.
Sometimes we talk for a long time.
Anitha is a good friend.
Today is a very good day.
